From 7481ce380f513fef4ec541dcb9cd8a8d3f712572 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 23:51:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] web: one flare page with a time cursor, live and archive
 sources (D-102)

The server-rendered page (D-100) becomes the time-cursor view in JS:
follows now (60 s poll), goes back through any period, switches between
the live service and a replayed archive (FLARE_ARCHIVE_URL). Proxies take
fuente=vivo|archivo; GOES X-ray flux from the portal's own rows
(datos/xray.json). explorar/ redirects here. es/en.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019TiLZJK6V4V5hFsgBRSyAK
